      "content": "WHA71.7 \n \n \n \n \n \n \n4 \n(8) \nto submit a report to the Seventy-third World Health Assembly in 2020 on the progress \nmade in implementing this resolution. \nSeventh plenary meeting, 26 May 2018 \nA71/VR/7 \n=     =     =",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
